    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Large horns of bestial or daemonic resemblance grow out of your skull; like antlers, tusks or curved spikes. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.BqPZn6q3VHn9HUrW]{Horns} SB+3 Creature Trait. The horns can be cut off and filed down, but will regrow by the rate of 1 inch per week. Each additional time you gain this mutation the horns grow and deal +1 Damage.</p>"
    },
